  dialogueLines:
  - Hey mom, me and some friends are going out later.
  - Could i borrow some money?
  - No, for dinner, not for drugs.
  - Mom, everyone is allergic to drugs, thats why you dont take them.
  - I know, i know, stay strong, dont get pushed around
  - I know mom, ill be fine.
  - No, i just need some time outside.
  - I feel like you dont see me in here.
  - Outside is better.
  - I would like to stay here a while.
  - I do wonder, from time to time.
  - What would have changed if you picked up the phone?
